# SYNC APP ONLY. The live build's PowerSync database file (BUILD-PLAN 4.1, PROMPT-10 Part 1).
# Not a secret: it is an OPFS file name, and OPFS is per origin. It MUST differ from every other
# app on adamnc02.github.io — personal-f's 'personal-finance.db' and the test app's
# 'finance-ledger-test-sync.db' — or two apps would share one local database
# (MIGRATION-LESSONS §32). database.ts throws when it is missing, by design.
VITE_POWERSYNC_DB_FILENAME=shared-finance-ledger.db
